OL,3,GNEWSASuspicious object declared        
OL,4,A'nothing untoward' as residents return 
OL,5,Ahome                                   
OL,7,FA security alert in County Armagh is   
OL,8,Fover after a suspicious object was     
OL,9,Fdeclared as "nothing untoward".        
OL,11,FHomes were evacuated in the Prince's   
OL,12,FClose area of Lurgan after the object  
OL,13,Fwas reported to the Police Service of  
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) shortly after  
OL,15,F16:30 GMT on Sunday.                   
OL,17,FPolice said the object was located at a
OL,18,Fproperty in the area.                  
OL,20,FA spokesperson for the PSNI said:      
OL,21,F"Officers recovered the object, which  
OL,22,Fhas been declared as nothing untoward. 
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
